body:

We welcome collaborations with institutions, researchers, and practitioners in the fields of sound, acoustics, mountaineering, and related disciplines. If you are interested in partnering with the MAN network, please get in touch.

## Get in touch

For collaboration inquiries, please contact **Gewenxin Yu** ([gewenxin.yu@proton.me](mailto:gewenxin.yu@proton.me)).
